          ],
          "content": "Node D has one parent: C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.382,
            0.284,
            0.4
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "3 At the Races"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.413,
            0.511,
            0.429
          ],
          "content": "1. You should bet on Bell. The expected value is \\$0.40."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.105,
            0.437,
            0.699,
            0.453
          ],
          "content": "2. You should take the \\$2 insurance and bet on Belle. The expected value is \\$1.7."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.475,
            0.348,
            0.493
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "4 Still At The Races"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.505,
            0.325,
            0.52
          ],
          "content": "Nodes F and H have no parents."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.521,
            0.345,
            0.536
          ],
          "content": "Node W has two parents: H and F."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.536,
            0.283,
            0.551
          ],
          "content": "Node B has one parent: H"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.551,
            0.282,
            0.566
          ],
          "content": "Node T has one parent: B"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.58,
            0.379,
            0.597
          ],
          "content": "P (W) = \\Sigma_ {F, H} P (W | F, H) P (F) P (H)",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_17.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.268,
            0.616,
            0.706,
            0.684
          ],
          "content": "\\begin{array}{r c l} P (W | T) & = & \\frac {P (W , T)}{P (T)} \\\\ & = & \\frac {\\Sigma_ {B , H , F} P (W | H , F) P (H) P (F) P (T | B) P (B | H)}{\\Sigma_ {B , H} P (T | B) P (B | H) P (H)} \\end{array}",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_18.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.7,
            0.195,
            0.72
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "5 Logic"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.731,
            0.305,
            0.747
          ],
          "content": "1. $\\forall x . B ( x ) \\land H ( x ) \\to S ( x )$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.755,
            0.305,
            0.771
          ],
          "content": "2. $\\forall x . S ( x ) \\land H ( x ) \\rightarrow B ( x )$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.78,
            0.305,
            0.795
          ],
          "content": "3. $\\forall x . S ( x ) \\to B ( x ) \\land H ( x )$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.803,
            0.299,
            0.819
          ],
          "content": "4. $\\exists x . S ( x ) \\land H ( x ) \\land B ( x )$"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.827,
            0.508,
            0.843
          ],
          "content": "\\exists x. H (x) \\land B (x) \\land \\forall y. (x \\neq y \\land H (x) \\rightarrow S l o w e r (x, y))",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_24.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.482,
            0.893,
            0.493,
            0.905
          ],
          "content": "1"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.85,
            0.29,
            0.867
          ],
          "content": "6. ∀ $r . R ( r ) \\rightarrow \\exists x . W ( x , r )$"
        }
      ]
    },
